  "brief": {"zh": "左轨的起始读数在 ACC，右轨的起始读数在地址 6。地址 0 到 5 依次交替存着左、右轨各三次的变化量。把六个变化量就地换成各自轨道当时的实际读数，保留地址 6。停机时 ACC 报告最后一次左轨读数减右轨读数。", "en": "ACC starts with the left rail reading. Address 6 holds the starting right rail reading. Addresses 0 to 5 alternate left and right changes for three rounds. Replace each change in place with its own rail’s reading at that moment. Preserve address 6 and halt with the last left reading minus the last right reading in ACC."},
